+//// Demo-mode in-memory store.
+////
+//// Pure MVU state on the Model (`Model.demo_store`): seeded from the JSON
+//// fixtures through the PRODUCTION `shared/` decoders, mutated only by
+//// demo dispatch, and re-seeded on every `/demo` entry and on "Reset demo".
+//// Non-persistence is by construction - a page refresh drops the whole
+//// Model, and nothing in this module (or anywhere in `demo/`) touches the
+//// network (the CI grep lint enforces that).
+////
+//// DERIVED, NOT SERIALIZED: the dashboard list, vacancy detail, leaderboard,
+//// application detail, comparison and archived views are all computed on
+//// demand from the single source of truth (vacancies + their applications).
+//// A mutation touches one place and every surface re-derives consistently -
+//// no parallel lists to drift.
+////
+//// The per-application craft (AI report content, documents, audit trail,
+//// reference calls, income/co-applicants) lives here, keyed by application
+//// id. It is constructed TYPED against the shared types (compile-time), and
+//// the conformance suite round-trips every derived surface through the
+//// shared ENCODERS + DECODERS so a codec drift fails `make test`.
+
